-- delete-box: remove the scratch BOX. Last case in the manifest, so the library
-- ends the recording logically where it started.
-- Ported from increment_fixture/cases/delete_apply.mac (navigate by name).
--
-- Destructive-by-design case: no restore leg (net = deleted). Q REF / Q NAME runs
-- BEFORE the delete — after it the element is gone and the recorder could not
-- resolve its refno from the log.

ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/db8000_scratch_delete.log" OVER
$P CODEX-DB8000-SCRATCH-DELETE-ALIVE
/CODEX_DB8000_SCRATCH
Q CE
Q REF
Q NAME
Q OWNE
DELETE BOX
Q CE
SAVEWORK 'CODEX db8000 delete scratch BOX /CODEX_DB8000_SCRATCH'
$P CODEX-DB8000-SCRATCH-DELETE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
